Copy this file to `.dev.vars` for local Pages Functions testing.
Use real local-only values in `.dev.vars`; never commit that file.

Required local keys:
- ADMIN_PASSWORD
- AUTH_SECRET
- OPENAI_API_KEY
- OPENAI_MODEL
- OPENAI_PROSPECT_MODEL
- SENDGRID_FROM_EMAIL
- SENDGRID_FROM_NAME
- SENDGRID_REPLY_TO_EMAIL
- SENDGRID_REPLY_TO_NAME
- SENDGRID_CC_EMAILS
- OUTBOUND_RECIPIENT_OVERRIDE
- AUTO_SEND_MIN_FIT_SCORE
- DAILY_SEND_LIMIT
- GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
- GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET
- GMAIL_CLIENT_ID
- GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET
- GMAIL_REDIRECT_URI
- TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY

Optional local key:
- SENDGRID_API_KEY
- REPLY_SYNC_TOKEN
- GMAIL_REPLY_QUERY
- GMAIL_SYNC_MAX_RESULTS
